name spectral
category Package
revision 57296
shortdesc Spectral fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Spectral family of fonts, designed by
longdesc Jean-Baptiste Levee at the Production Type digital type design
longdesc agency. Spectral is a new and versatile serif face available in
longdesc seven weights of roman and italic, with small caps.
execute addMap spectral.map
containersize 3545232
containerchecksum 46f6aba88425deb74e921ceafa578e9e8c467a5f9ada72b1372f6e70957946adb56bb05700a839249b2387472f4059a2dfbf4b83cb9979a4936442dac5c9258c
